  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the implementation and analysis of safety nets support under NASSP SU program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives: 1. Implementation support to and assessment of the shock responsive cash transfer program under NASSP SU. The EFO output would be additional data collected; NASSP SU project implementation informed and supported; and information developed for wider operational and strategic communication and policy dialogue. 
2. Support the impact evaluation of livelihoods support interventions. The EFO will co-finance data collection of the endline survey by expanding the scope of data collection and analysis to include measurement and analysis of food security and nutrition outcomes. The EFO output would be additional data collected on food security and nutrition impacts of safety nets interventions; and information developed for wider operational and strategic communication and policy dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
